     <P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=center><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第一章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN></SPAN>总<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>则</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第一条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">为切实增强对学生思想品德教育和日常行为规范教育的针对性和实效性，进一步推动学校形成良好的校风、学风，根据教育部新版《中小学生守则》、《中学生日常行为规范》，浙江省教育厅《普通高级中学学生学籍管理办法（试行）》和绍兴市教育局相关文件精神，结合学校实际，制定本规定。 </SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二条</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">本规定适用于全体在籍学生。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第三条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学校提倡和培养学生自治、自理、自律能力，坚持正面教育的原则，实行宽严结合，伴以必要的纪律约束和处分，确保校规校纪的严肃性和权威性。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第四条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">处理学生，应当做到程序正当、证据充分、依据明确、定性准确、处分适当。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第五条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">对有违纪、违规行为的学生，处理分为德育处批评教育、通报批评、警告、严重警告、记过五种，构成违法行为的报送执法机关依法处理。造成学校和他人财产损失按价赔偿。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第六条</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">接受德育处批评教育、通报批评的学生当学期取消评先评优、各类推优以及自主招生、三位一体推荐等资格；接受警告、严重警告、记过处分的学生当学期至撤销处分前，均无评先评优、各类推优以及自主招生、三位一体、警校、出国留学推荐资格。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第七条</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">违纪学生有下列情形之一的，可从轻或减轻处分：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 微软雅黑; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（一）能主动承认违纪行为，认识深刻，悔改表现突出的；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 微软雅黑; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（二）能主动反映他人违纪行为，经查证属实的。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=center><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>违纪行为及处理</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第八条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学生有下列情形之一，需接受德育处批评教育。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
