<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=center><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第三章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>违纪处理程序</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十二条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>学生违纪行为的调查：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（一）违纪事件的调查，若涉及校园安全方面的，由安全处负责；涉及考试违纪的，由教务处负责；其他方面的，由年级组负责，有关部门参与；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（二）违纪事件的调查要了解学生违纪行为的事实经过和搜集相关证据材料。在做好思想工作，让学生深刻认识错误并做出书面检查的基础上，形成情况调查报告；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.65pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（三） 违纪学生所在年级，要根据学生违纪事实和学校有关规定，在听取有关部门意见后，做出错误性质的认定并提出处分的初步意见，报学校德育处，由德育处上报分管领导研究决定，或上报学校校务会议作出决定。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十三条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">违纪处分的审批权限：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.65pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Tahoma>（一）批评教育和通报批评一般由年级组提出，交德育处决定并执行；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.65pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（二）警告、严重警告由年级组提出，德育处上报分管领导研究决定，德育处执行并备案；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.65pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（三）记过处分由年级组报德育处，德育处报请分管领导，并上报学校校务会议作出决定，德育处执行并备案；</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十四条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">在对违纪学生做出处分决定之前，应当听取学生或其代理人的陈述和申辩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（一）学生在接到“违纪处分意见书”后，应明确签署“同意”或“申辩”。申辩应在接到《学生违纪处分意见书》之日起</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">五个工作日<SPAN style="COLOR: #333333">内提出并递交书面申辩书，逾期不予受理。</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=Tahoma>（二）拟受处分学生</FONT><A name=_GoBack></A><FONT face=Tahoma>的申辩一般由班主任听取。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（三）学生本人必须对自己违纪行为进行客观描述，并根据相关规定提出明确的“自我处理意见”。如申辩过程中理解有变化，应逐一记录，以时间最迟者为准。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（四）班主任听取学生申辩时应认真作好笔记，结束时拟受处分学生或其代理人应在笔录上签字。学生申辩后班主任根据笔录整理成书面报告，并附笔录原件，送年级或德育处。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（五）年级或德育处在学生或其代理人的陈述和申辩过程中，应作出如下处理：属学生认知偏差或无正当理由的，应通过学生家长等多种方式教育学生，教育引导有效的应反映在学生的自我描述中，教育引导无效的必须附详细教育材料；学生自认事实和定性与年级或德育处定性确有偏差的，年级或德育处应高度重视予以核查，如有必要应补证或重新取证。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">（六）学生的申辩材料及相关报告应归入学生处分材料，作为学生处分报告的附件。对学生作出处分决定前，学校德育处应审阅学生的申辩材料。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十五条</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学校对学生做出的处分决定书，应当包括处分和处分事实、理由及依据。处分决定书有学生本人或本人与家长签字。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=center><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第四章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>违纪学生的教育管理</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十六条</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">处分决定书生效后，年级或德育处有关人员要与受处分的学生谈话，进一步帮助其提高认识。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十七条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>受警告及警告以上处分的学生所在班级，可以指定两名学生干部作为联系人，经常开展谈心活动，受处分的学生定期以书面形式汇报思想认识，班主任定期关注，其表现作为处分撤销的依据。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十八条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>学生警告及警告以上处分的期限一般为半年，在处分期间，确有悔改表现者，经师生评议，学校批准，可撤销其处分。未成年学生的处分撤销后，学校应将其处分记录从学生个人学籍档案中撤除。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第十九条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">对少数品德行为偏常和有违法行为的学生，可进行特殊教育。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 6pt 0cm; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: .5gd; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .5gd; mso-para-margin-left: 0cm; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=center><FONT face=Tahoma><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第五章<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>附<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>则</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二十条<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">本规定由学校德育处负责解释。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt -0.1pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0cm; mso-para-margin-right: 0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom: .0001pt; mso-para-margin-left: -.01gd; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二十一条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">学校其他有关文件规定与本规定不一致的，以本规定为准。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style='FONT-SIZE: 11.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: "微软雅黑","sans-serif"; COLOR: #333333; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体'><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto"><FONT face=Tahoma><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">第二十二条 </SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">本规定自<SPAN lang=EN-US>2018</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日起试行。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="BACKGROUND: white; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; LINE-HEIGHT: 20pt; TEXT-INDENT: 23.75pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.97; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: auto" align=right><FONT size=4 face=Tahoma><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: #333333; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体">                                                                                                          德育处</SPAN></FONT></P>
    
